  "title": "A criterion for non-robust quasi-isometry in SL3(R): free-group representations with a repeated-eigenvalue word and an aligned loxodromic plane admit arbitrarily small unipotent-word deformations",
  "item_path": "items/927_author_proof.tex",
  "author": "León Carvajales; Pablo Lessa; Rafael Potrie",
